5) With the Doctor -
When a boy with bad luck returns a one-eyed cat to the Animal Clinic written on his registration tag, his luck only worsens... Turns out, the cat belongs to the same clinic he took his own sick dog to two years ago... and the extremely irate doctor who tore him a new asshole for animal neglect.

6) Rabbit Ear Kindergarten -
