-  Feeler
Poor Mei is baffled. Her dear older brother acts like he doesn''t even notice her. He claims he''s studying, but is that the real reason? So she tries to catch his attention with a borrowed video game. But even then he seems so distant... Mei flops down into her brother''s lap like she used to do when they were kids--and is shocked at her brother''s reaction!

