In a society in which he believes one cannot live without either taking advantage of or being taken advantage of, Ushijima strives to be the former, operating in the black market and issuing loans to those he knows cannot afford the principal, let alone the mounting interest. However, he intends to have every yen he gives out to be paid back in full.

Yamikin Ushijima-kun follows Ushijima as he wrings his dues out of his customers, believing all of his clients to be undeserving of his compassion. Whether it be prostitution, identity theft, or extortion, there are no miseries Ushijima is unwilling to put his customers through as he journeys through the underworld.');
Terrified of what people would say, Mai never confessed her feelings to Ikeda when they were in middle school. Though they briefly dated, Ikeda''s frustration with having to keep their relationship a secret caused them to split up and go their separate ways in high school. Even though a year has passed, Mai still has lingering feelings for the boy, which holds her back from pursuing other relationships. But a chance encounter with Ikeda on a bus has the girl wondering if she will finally get her thoughts off her chest.

Gyoubou Hoshizora
Vain and lazy Mizurin Akiyoshi dreams of getting a scholarship to Tan High School so she can coast through life easily. Unfortunately, her terrible grades and lack of involvement in extracurricular activities make this dream impossible. Still determined to see this unfeasible goal through, she hastily joins the school''s astronomy club, hoping it will be an easy commitment. But the club leader, Sora Yasunaga, refuses to let her just be a member on paper, making Mizurin''s plans all the more difficult.

Junjou Shuushinki
While her friends always talk about their sexual experiences, Asumi cannot relate to them—she has not done anything with Keishi, her boyfriend of six months, just yet. Frustrated with how childish he is, Asumi decides to take matters into her own hands and turn him into an adult on their next date.

Shuushin Ice Cube
Although she recently debuted as an erotic romance novelist, high school student Juu Mangetsu is secretly a virgin who has not been in a relationship since middle school. Believing that her writing is a recounting of her sexual experiences, her classmate Shiizaki confesses to her, only to be rejected. But when her editor comes to her with a proposal to write another series, Juu finds herself turning to the very boy she rejected in hopes of getting ideas for the manuscript. What she ends up finding may be more than what she bargained for.');

(Source: AniDB)

