The reason for the hatred between Komori and Kyou is soon revealed: Kyou is in reality the daughter of her father’s mistress, who is also Komori’s mother. Komori has always been jealous of Kyou since she has a central place in their mother’s heart, as she discovered by reading her mother’s diary.

