Madonna ni Tsugu:
Mizusawa Karen, a very skilled archer, was taken in 5 years ago by her father''s good friend, the head surgeon of the Tokyo police department medical hospital.  On her 16th birthday, however, her adoptive father tells her that she has a bomb implanted in her heart that is set to go off in a week.  Now she and two friends must find her real father to have any hopes of surviving...

Umi wa Shizuka na Aki no Meikyuu:
Mio''s boyfriend Shou has been missing at sea for several days.  Everyone including even Shou''s grandparents have given up hope of finding him alive, but Mio is determined to continue searching.  One day, she meets a curious guy named Ai, who helps her search and together, they find out that things may not be as they seem...

Toori-ma 1991:
Kiryuu Naoya becomes the private tutor of his friend Ohtakemaru''s younger sister, who can''t leave the house b/c of her fragile health.  Strange occurrences keep happening around the Ohtakemaru siblings, however, and a rumor of a killer on the loose around the premises of their house have begun to circulate.  Naoya also seems to have a secret that he doesn''t want the siblings to know about, but all of this comes to light one night when...??');

(Source: CMX)');

(Source: CMX)');

X-Day:
4 short depictions of tragic misunderstandings and their consequences.  

4nin no Onna:
A very famous, rich, old hotel owner is found dead and when the police come to investigate, his long-time maid says that her master was killed by 4 women...

Kanojo wa Dare wo Koroshitaka:
A woman is found covered in blood walking through the streets of Tokyo.  When questioned by a policeman, she utters that she has killed someone.  To figure out what happened, the officer begins to read her intriguing diary...

Hirotta Otoko:
The five members of Maki''s family are so picture perfect that they even star in heart-warming commercials advertising food and a happy, loving family.  But what are they really like beneath the surface?  They''re forced to find out when they pick up a mysterious guy named George, who they almost run over by car on their way to their winter lodge...');

Megami ga Ochita Hi:
Monika works at "Safari Island" a huge nature park in the middle of the ocean, where people can come to see African animals of all kinds while staying at resorts.  She loves the animals she works with as well as her now retired grandfather.  Everyday she works hard to make sure the park runs smoothly and that her grandfather is as happy as he can be, but a helicopter that crashes into the island scarily changes everything...

Kowai Mono:
4 friends enter an amusement park and are ushered into a special attraction, where a mysterious man asks each of them to share their biggest fear.  In return, he tells them the disturbing truths about their fears...

Kinezukan:
A group of friends who are now old and retired commiserate with each other about how they are being treated as burdens by their families.  Just as they are wondering if it''s sadly time for them to volunteer to move into retirement communities, two dangerous bank robbers appear and...???');

But despite the appearances, Naoyuki is not a girl but a guy, and even Kazuki''s childhood friend! This weird trio will meet many characters, all more interesting and complicated than the others.

