On the giant space ship Exculsus, King Kravitz and his queen, Clara, maintain rule over a very large population of permanent ship residents.  Among Kravitz''s responsibilities is to produce offspring with the ship''s women, but his failure to produce a child with the queen has led to tension and disquiet on board.  The queen''s purchase of a strange telepathic blue-eyed monkey temporarily lightens the mood, but is her care of such a foreign animal truly safe to her and her people?  

