Poor Takashi. After school one day, he comes home and is confronted by his mom who found a pair of her dirty panties in his dresser. Embarrased, he runs over to his step-sister Kaede''s place where she comforts him with sex. What Takashi doesn''t know, is that his mom was actually very happy that he had a pair of her panties. When Takashi returns home, he tells his mom that he wants to live with Kaede (whom she despises). His mom, of course, has sex with him to get him to stay with her. At this point, both Takashi''s mom and Kaede "compete" with each other to see which of the two Takashi prefers most...

8. Boku wa Tabako wa Suki de wa nai (I Don''t Like Cigarettes)
This is actually a sequel to the chapter, "I Don''t Like Cigarettes" that can be found in Chijo. Now that Rokujo has been seeing Kurokawa-sensei everyday, he has been coming home late from school and his mom is suspicious. Thinking that Rokujo might have a girlfriend she doesn''t know about, she goes to the school to find out exactly what''s going on...

9. Kaede no Himitsu (Kaede''s Secret)
This is a very short prequel to "Sister Mother Lechery"

