Her Circumstances
Yui is a captivating high school enchantress who allows male students to use her body as they please. But this brings no pleasure to Yui. In fact, she does this simply for her own perverted entertainment. After so much unfinished and meaningless intercourse, even someone as resolute as Yui can become sexually frustrated. Fortunately, her charming underclassman of the same gender, Sayori, is available to quench her lust.

Far Behind Spring
Moe Shinohara is a young girl who is terrible at swimming, so much so that she finds it difficult to swim 25 meters! Due to her incompetence, she is forced to stay after school to partake in extra swimming lessons. However, Moe isn''t the only inept swimmer; she is joined by the good-looking and silky-haired Aki Toiu. But as the two prepare in the changing room, Aki unexpectedly announces her passionate love for Moe.

Alone with Nee-chan
