Spring Blossoming
Mayu is an adolescent girl who bears a forbidden and immoral lust for her own mother, who is oblivious to her daughter''s carnal desires. So far, Mayu has satisfied her craving by masturbating in her bedroom. But when she walks in on her mother collecting some breast milk, she can no longer control her urges. 

My Mother is a Witch
