Hibiki''s unusually powerful demon catches the attention of JP''s—a secret government research organization that appears to understand the current situation. It is there that Hibiki learns that humanity has seven days to defeat invaders known as the "Septentriones" in order to prevent the world from being eroded away. Having defeated the first one already, he must now join forces with the other fated "Devil Summoners" to repel the threat.');

