However, Kasane''s life takes a turn for the better when she remembers her mother''s words—to wear her lipstick and kiss whoever she desires. Much to Kasane''s astonishment, the first person she kisses while wearing the lipstick causes her to temporarily switch faces with them. Now given a chance to pursue her ambitions, to what lengths will Kasane use this newfound power?');

