In order to make friends, he applied for the closed beta test for the world''s first VRMMORPG ''Another World,'' something that had become quite the topic among his classmates. However, while he was chosen to be a tester, none of his classmates were chosen and he ended up having to play ''Another World'' alone. When he was in ''Another World,'' he encountered a support AI girl named Teis, and through her invitation, he was transferred to what seemed to be the imaginary world ''Istopia.'' But the ''Istopia'' where he was transferred to was not an imaginary world, but another world that bore striking similarities to the imaginary world.');

College student Minami Shougo regularly visits the office of Kanbara Kenji, a designer prodigy he has been close to his entire life, and whom he loves. Ever since he was a child, Kenji has always been studious and selfish... And Shougo, despite being younger ends up taking care of him. Other than the main story, you''ll also find a love story between reunited childhood friends, and a romance starting at a restaurant... This is a collection of dreamy love stories! 

