Nogiku was that otome game''s villain character. She got in the way of the protagonist''s love who sought to get closer to the men, and in the end she would even kill, she was a woman who wasn''t choosy with her methods. Because she was that type of woman she was given hellish punishment by the protagonist and company, but...

