A tale of a cannibal mermaid now unable to stop thinking about how her citizens would taste, Ningyohime no Gomen ne Gohan follows Era''s desperate attempts to hide her urges and her dark secret.');

Ashtal waits for over a 1000 years, yet no band of heroes arrive to kill him. However, finally, after longing for some heroes to show up at his doorstep for 1005 years, a group of heroes, led by the second princess of the Britton Kingdom named Yufilia Plantagenet, barge in to slay the mythic "Evil God".

After a rather emberassing encounter with this all-female group of heroes, Ashtal decides to quit his life of observation to attend school with the ones who came to slay him.

