When she meets Julian for the third time, Leah tells him all about her previous lives. They unexpectedly form a beautiful friendship, and the day of Julian''s proposal approaches. But something strangely sinister bubbles under the surface bliss, and the truth behind all the years Leah has lived is a shadow she cannot outrun.');

