​Kiyoharu Godou is a high schooler who has had absolutely zero luck with girls. But one day, he falls head over heels at first sight for a girl at his school. He gets so lovesick that he can''t even focus on his part-time job. Driven to desperation, he visits a local shrine to pray for a good match. But out of nowhere, a girl claiming to be the Goddess of Matchmaking pops right out of the offering box?! ​Now, an ordinary high school guy has ended up bound by fate to a literal goddess! Where on earth will this romance lead?!

(Source: Takeshobo, translated)');

Then a charming, incredibly handsome man named Makoto comes to her rescue as she''s being harassed late one night. Enraptured by his pretty face and alluring words, Ren finds herself following him to a love hotel and finally has her first time! And oh, what a time...Makoto is not only gentle, he seems to know her most sensitive spots.

For a one-night stand, it''s truly epic—until Ren and Makoto meet again, and she finds out he''s a well-known tea ceremony master. Could something more bloom between them?

(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)');

First, I have to get through their oppressive training, where failure equals death. My assassin-to-be rivals include a tigerborn whose strength eclipses my own, an elf who is a master of essence, and a dragonborn, their kind known as the mightiest of races. Isn''t all that almost unfair?

Although death lurks around every corner, I swear I''ll claw my way through this hell. Manipulating powerful foes and the adults around me, punishing those who stand in my way... If that makes me a monster, so be it.

There is nothing and no one I won''t tear down for the sake of survival.

Not a shred of morality sees the light in this darkest of fantasies.

(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)');

(Source: Kodansha, translated)');
